          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 22 2022 17:57:58 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n <br>\n <br>\n <br>\n <br>\n Together with our customers, we’re creating a better, healthier world. Our 2021 Comprehensive Report highlights our commitment to stronger people, a healthier planet and good business.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">“In 2021, Stryker returned to growth and delivered strong results despite the ongoing challenges of the pandemic,” said Stryker's Chair and CEO, Kevin Lobo. “I want to thank our customers, whose dedication to patient care in the face of another demanding year continues to inspire our work and whose collaboration keeps us innovating to make healthcare better. I’d also like to thank our employees, whose drive and resilience allowed us to adapt quickly to the changing environment. In particular, our commercial and manufacturing teams have worked tirelessly to support our customers in hospitals, care settings and at our facilities across the world.”</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Mar 22 2022 18:01:01 GMT+0000",
